		// Let's just return the underlying error, which will be "json: cannot unmarshal number into Go value of type string"
		// But then outer error will be "json: cannot unmarshal number into Go struct field Config.OnCancel of type config.OnCancelBehavior"? No, it will be different.
		// Actually for custom Unmarshaler, Go's error handling is different.
